# Each attribute names a gate. `build` marks a path whose change must start Build, and
# `-build` a path whose change need not. Quality, Records, Commits and Sign-off always
# run, so none has an attribute.
#
# A pattern that reaches the root, such as `*` or `*.rs`, marks a path before anyone
# decides it, and the lint then passes that path.
#
#   the task:  mise run lint:gates

.github/**                    -build
.github/workflows/build.yml   build
.config/mise.toml             build
.config/mise.lock             build
.config/tasks.toml            build
.config/gates                 build
.config/readers               -build
.config/cliff.toml            -build
/Cargo.toml                   build
/Cargo.lock                   build
src/**                        build
/pyproject.toml               build
/README.md                    build
/LICENSE                      build
.gitignore                    build
.gitattributes                build

/AGENTS.md                    -build
/CLAUDE.md                    -build
/CONTEXT.md                   -build
/CONTRIBUTING.md              -build
/LANDSCAPE.md                 -build
/deny.toml                    -build
/prek.toml                    -build
/.editorconfig                -build
/.shellcheckrc                -build
docs/**                       -build
scripts/**                    -build
